Package: com.martintrasak.twofcrop
Name: twoFCrop
Description: Drag two crop handles at once
 iOS lets you move one crop handle at a time. twoFCrop lets you drag two, so you
 can frame a crop in a single gesture instead of nudging each side in turn.
 .
 Works in the Photos editor and in the editor that opens when you tap the
 thumbnail after taking a screenshot. Any two handles can be used together:
 opposite corners, adjacent corners, opposite edges, or an edge and a corner.
